WEBVTT

00:00:03.194 --> 00:00:06.760
Manage dates lists the departures buyers can choose.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:11.432
Each shows its date, how many are booked, paid and held, its capacity,

00:00:11.432 --> 00:00:14.014
its price, and whether it is closed.

00:00:14.476 --> 00:00:16.627
Click Add date to add a departure.

00:00:16.627 --> 00:00:20.122
Give it a Date, its own Capacity, and, if you like, its own

00:00:20.122 --> 00:00:22.756
Price, such as a higher one in high season.

00:00:23.215 --> 00:00:24.181
Click Save.

00:00:24.181 --> 00:00:28.610
A date left at the product's own capacity and price shows The product's,

00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:30.825
and a full date cannot be bought.

